onne des parts plus petites qu'en ${{b}}$ : $\\frac{1}{{{d}}} < \\frac{1}{{{b}}}$. Avec ${{a}}$ parts de chaque côté, $\\frac{{{a}}}{{{d}}} < \\frac{{{a}}}{{{b}}}$.","$$\\frac{{{gn}}}{{{gd}}} \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{if:r==0|<|{{if:r==1|=|>}}}}} \\frac{{{dn}}}{{{dd}}}$$"]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{r}}"}],"statement":"Complète avec le signe qui convient.\n\n$$\\frac{{{gn}}}{{{gd}}} \\ldots \\frac{{{dn}}}{{{dd}}}$$\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- $<$\n- $=$\n- $>$\n```","variables":[{"name":"b","expression":"3..12"},{"name":"a","expression":"1..{{eval:b-1}}"},{"name":"d","expression":"2..12"},{"name":"c","expression":"{{eval:d+1}}..{{eval:2*d-1}}"},{"name":"s","expression":"0..1"},{"name":"gn","expression":"eval:(1-s)*a+s*c"},{"name":"gd","expression":"eval:(1-s)*b+s*d"},{"name":"dn","expression":"eval:(1-s)*c+s*a"},{"name":"dd","expression":"eval:(1-s)*d+s*b"},{"name":"r","expression":"eval:sign(gn*dd-dn*gd)+1"}],"conditions":["gcd(a,b)==1","gcd(c,d)==1"],"correction":{"steps":["**Comparer à 1.** $\\frac{{{a}}}{{{b}}} < 1$ car ${{a}} < {{b}}$, et $\\frac{{{c}}}{{{d}}} > 1$ car ${{c}} > {{d}}$ : donc $\\frac{{{a}}}{{{b}}} < \\frac{{{c}}}{{{d}}}$.","$$\\frac{{{gn}}}{{{gd}}} \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{if:r==0|<|{{if:r==1|=|>}}}}} \\frac{{{dn}}}{{{dd}}}$$"]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{r}}"}],"statement":"Complète avec le signe qui convient.\n\n$$\\frac{{{gn}}}{{{gd}}} \\ldots \\frac{{{dn}}}{{{dd}}}$$\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- $<$\n- $=$\n- $>$\n```","variables":[{"name":"b","expression":"4..12"},{"name":"a","expression":"1..{{eval:floor((b-1)/2)}}"},{"name":"d","expression":"4..12"},{"name":"c","expression":"{{eval:floor(d/2)+1}}..{{eval:d-1}}"},{"name":"s","expression":"0..1"},{"name":"gn","expression":"eval:(1-s)*a+s*c"},{"name":"gd","expression":"eval:(1-s)*b+s*d"},{"name":"dn","expression":"eval:(1-s)*c+s*a"},{"name":"dd","expression":"eval:(1-s)*d+s*b"},{"name":"r","expression":"eval:sign(gn*dd-dn*gd)+1"}],"conditions":["gcd(a,b)==1