  $q6sc${"title":"Appliquer une fraction à un entier","description":"Traduire « de » par une multiplication ; calculer une fraction d'un entier, en simplifiant d'abord (2/5 de 60 = 2 × 12) ou avec un résultat fractionnaire (5/4 de 3 = 15/4)","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"0"}],"statement":"Calculer $\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}}$ de ${{n}}$, c'est calculer :\n\n```choix\n- $\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}} \\times {{n}}$\n- $\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}} + {{n}}$\n- ${{n}} - \\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}}$\n- ${{n}} \\div \\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}}$\n```","variables":[{"name":"q","expression":"2..9"},{"name":"p","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"k","expression":"2..12"},{"name":"n","expression":"eval:q*k"}],"conditions":["gcd(p,q)==1","p!=q","n<=100","p>=2"],"correction":{"steps":["**Fraction d'un nombre.** Pour calculer une fraction d'un nombre entier, on multiplie la fraction par le nombre : « de » se traduit par « $\\times$ ».","$\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}}$ de ${{n}}$ $= \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}} \\times {{n}}}$"]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:p*k}}"}],"statement":"Calcule.\n\n$$\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}} \\text{ de } {{n}} = ?$$","variables":[{"name":"q","expression":"2..9"},{"name":"p","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"k","expression":"2..12"},{"name":"n","expression":"eval:q*k"}],"conditions":["gcd(p,q)==1","p!=q","n<=100","p>=2"],"correction":{"steps":["**Fraction d'un nombre.** Pour calculer une fraction d'un nombre entier, on multiplie la fraction par le nombre : « de » se traduit par « $\\times$ ».","$\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}}$ de ${{n}}$, c'est ${{p}}$ fois $\\frac{1}{{{q}}}$ de ${{n}}$ ; on simplifie d'abord : ${{n}} \\div {{q}} = {{k}}$.","$$\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}} \\times {{n}} = {{p}} \\times \\frac{{{n}}}{{{q}}} = {{p}} \\times {{k}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{solution}}}$$"]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"\\frac{{{eval:p*n}}}{{{q}}}"}],"statement":"Calcule. Donne le résultat sous forme d'une fraction.\n\n$$\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}} \\text{ de } {{n}} = ?$$","variables":[{"name":"q","expression":"2..9"},{"name":"p","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"n","expression":"2..9"}],"conditions":["gcd(p,q)==1","gcd(n,q)==1","p!=q","p>=2"],"correction":{"steps":["**Fraction d'un nombre.** Pour calculer une fraction d'un nombre entier, on multiplie la fraction par le nombre : « de » se traduit par « $\\times$ ».","$\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}}$ de ${{n}}$, c'est ${{p}}$ fois $\\frac{1}{{{q}}}$ de ${{n}}$, c'est-à-dire ${{p}}$ fois $\\frac{{{n}}}{{{q}}}$.","$$\\frac{{{p}}}{{{q}}} \\times {{n}} = {{p}} \\times \\frac{{{n}}}{{{q}}} = \\frac{{{p}} \\times {{n}}}{{{q}}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{solution}}}$$"]}}],"shared":null,"test_specs":[{"answers":["0"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k":"12","n":"60","p":"2","q":"5"},"description":"2/5 de 60 : 2/5 × 60","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["3"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"12","n":"60","p":"2","q":"5"},"description":"Erreur : 60 ÷ 2/5","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["24"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k":"12","n":"60","p":"2","q":"5"},"description":"2/5 de 60 = 24","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["150"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"12","n":"60","p":"2","q":"5"},"description":"Erreur : rôles inversés (60 ÷ 2 × 5 = 150)","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["12"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"12","n":"60","p":"2","q":"5"},"description":"Erreur : un cinquième seulement (12)","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["\\frac{15}{4}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"n":"3","p":"5","q":"4"},"description":"5/4 de 3 = 15/4","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["3,75"],"expected":{"status":"bad_form","constraintViolations":["form"]},"variables":{"n":"3","p":"5","q":"4"},"description":"3,75 : la consigne demande une fraction","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["\\frac{5}{12}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"n":"3","p":"5","q":"4"},"description":"Erreur : 5/12","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["\\frac{